For the tribe PSS, we are looking for a Product Owner to join the team of our SWIFT/IRM/GFME Financial Messaging Platform.
The Product Owner works most of its time in a squad within ING’s Agile organization, together with other experts to achieve the squad’s mission specifically on collecting, centralizing and organizing all needed evidences for the above mentioned questionnaires . The Product Owner has expertise in the areas of product management (SWIFT, MT and MX messaging, ISO20022) and process optimization.
